  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Campias Flooding Control Program</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">Programa Control Inundaciones Campias</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">THE PROGRAM CONSISTS MAINLY OF DRAINAGE WORKS IN THE CRITICAL FLOOD AREAS IN THE CITY. IT INCLUDES SEVERAL COMPONENTS FOR: URBANIZATION OF SHANTY TOWNS ALONG THE CREEKS, THAT ARE SUBJECTED TO FLOODING AND RESETTLEMENT OF LOW-INCOME FAMILIES LIVING IN RISK AREAS; PRESERVATION OF GREEN AREAS; ENVIRONMENTAL EDUCATION; AND THE INSTITUTIONAL AND FINANCIAL STRENGTHENING OF THE MUNICIPALITY.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="ES"></narrative>
  </description>
